<%# Overrides Devise's default template, whose link points at the API's
    /api/v1/auth/password/edit — a route that only exists as JSON. The
    reset happens on the web app, so link its page instead. MAILER_HOST
    is the same web-origin knob production.rb feeds action_mailer. %>
<% reset_url = "#{ENV.fetch('MAILER_HOST', 'https://bite-worthy.com').chomp('/')}/reset-password?reset_password_token=#{@token}" %>
<p>Hello <%= @resource.email %>,</p>

<p>Someone — hopefully you — asked to reset your BiteWorthy password.</p>

<p><a href="<%= reset_url %>">Choose a new password</a></p>

<p>The link expires in 6 hours. If you didn't ask for this, ignore this
email — your password won't change without the link being used.</p>
